## 3. Flop Coding Styles & Reset Strategies

Flip-Flops are critical sequential elements used to store state and eliminate combinational glitches.

### Asynchronous Reset
The reset signal immediately overrides the clock signal to reset the registers.
```verilog
always @(posedge clk or posedge async_reset) begin
    if (async_reset)
        q <= 1'b0;
    else
        q <= d;
end
